# Copy to .env.local and fill in. The app picks the storage driver automatically:

#   DATABASE_URL unset    -> JSON file at ./data/store.json (offline demo default)
#   DATABASE_URL=postgres://...    -> Postgres (Neon / local Docker / Vercel Marketplace)

# --- Postgres (recommended for any multi-user / production use) -----------
# Neon (https://neon.tech) — copy from the dashboard, then uncomment:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# --- Mode -----------------------------------------------------------------
# SCOUT_MODE=offline                       # default; uses seeded signals
# SCOUT_MODE=live                          # performs real web collection

# --- Search providers for live mode (SCOUT_MODE=live) ----------------------
# Tavily (recommended for production — better keyless rate than news APIs):
# TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...
# GDELT and Google News are keyless (rate-limited by network from some hosts)
# GitHub (60/h keyless, 5000/h with token):
# GH_TOKEN=ghp_...
# Reddit (polite spacing, descriptive UA required):
# REDDIT_USER_AGENT="bial-scout/1.0 (commercial research; neeraj@example.com)"
# YouTube Data API (optional — falls back to public HTML scrape):
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=...
# arXiv (keyless, polite 1s spacing — no key needed)

# --- LLM extraction (brand-level precision from collected signals) --------
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=...                   # Vercel AI Gateway (works with any model)
